<title>USA: Spieker raises dividend.</title>
<headline>Spieker raises dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MENLO PARK, Calif. 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spieker Properties Inc said its board increased its quarterly dividend by 9.3 percent to $0.47 per share from $0.43.</p>
<p>The dividend will be paid April 18, 1997, to shareholders of record as of March 31, 1997.</p>
